.opus-build/

## Archives + exported IPAs (built by `make archive` / `make export`)
build/

## Anything that smells like a private key — defence in depth so a stray
## .p8/.p12/.cer next to the project doesn't end up in the repo.
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision

## Per-developer signing config (Team ID + profile name). The .example
## variants are committed as templates; copy → fill in → use.
Signing.local.xcconfig
ExportOptions.local.plist
